- Group: The Resource Access Management (RAM) user synchronization is a CloudSSO group.', example='Group', position='Query'),
  targetId?: string(name='TargetId', description='The ID of the destination for the Resource Access Management (RAM) user synchronization. Currently, the value is the ID of the account in a resource directory.', example='1743382******', position='Query'),
  targetType?: string(name='TargetType', description='The type of the destination for the Resource Access Management (RAM) user synchronization. Currently, the only valid value is `RD-Account`.', example='RD-Account', position='Query'),
